'''Battle Fury''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shout]] added by the [[Skyrim:Dragonborn|Dragonborn]] expansion that improves the fighting ability of allies by speeding up their attacks, similar to the [[Skyrim:Elemental Fury|Elemental Fury]] shout's effect on you.

== Related Quests ==
*{{Quest Link|Lost Legacy}}

== Notes ==
*Like Elemental Fury, if this shout is used on an ally whose weapon is already enchanted, it has no effect.

